From c5f3705ee27c1952113694419ff601171ffb9468 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AlpaBridge maintainers <alpabridge@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 12:05:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] driver: expose session identity to PredictionInput

Replaces route_waypoints.patch, whose larger half upstream has since
implemented itself. As of alpasim main @ 1e801ca (August 2026 public sync),
PredictionInput natively carries:

- `route` (the latest submitted Route, waypoints in the rig frame), backed by
  a new `Session.route` field -- what this override previously added as
  `PredictionInput.route_waypoints` / `Session.current_route` /
  `Session.route_waypoints_for_prediction()`.
- `inference_seed` (session seed plus the zero-based inference count) -- a
  strictly better version of what this override added as
  `runtime_random_seed`.

AlpaBridge needs no code change to consume either: route_waypoints_from_input
already probes `route` among its candidate attribute names and unwraps
`.waypoints`, and prediction_runtime_metadata's seed candidates now include
`inference_seed`.

What upstream still does not forward, and this patch therefore keeps, is
session identity. Session has `uuid` and `debug_scene_id` as required fields,
but neither reaches the model:

- `session_uuid` is load-bearing, not just telemetry: AlpaSimContractValidator
  uses it to detect a session transition and reset per-session state. Without
  it the frozen-camera check carries state across a session boundary, which is
  precisely the check AlpaBridge exists to make trustworthy.
- `debug_scene_id` is what the audit trail correlates rollout records by.

Both fields are optional with defaults, so upstream's own PredictionInput
construction sites are unaffected -- unlike the fields upstream added, which
are required positionally.
---
 src/driver/src/alpasim_driver/main.py        | 2 ++
 src/driver/src/alpasim_driver/models/base.py | 7 +++++++
 2 files changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/driver/src/alpasim_driver/main.py b/src/driver/src/alpasim_driver/main.py
index eb08eac..3bf9e92 100644
--- a/src/driver/src/alpasim_driver/main.py
+++ b/src/driver/src/alpasim_driver/main.py
@@ -724,6 +724,8 @@ class EgoDriverService(EgodriverServiceServicer):
                     inference_seed=inference_seed,
                     previous_plan=job.session.last_selected_plan,
                     route=job.session.route,
+                    session_uuid=job.session.uuid,
+                    debug_scene_id=job.session.debug_scene_id,
                 )
             )
 
diff --git a/src/driver/src/alpasim_driver/models/base.py b/src/driver/src/alpasim_driver/models/base.py
index a39a852..f25c6b5 100644
--- a/src/driver/src/alpasim_driver/models/base.py
+++ b/src/driver/src/alpasim_driver/models/base.py
@@ -64,6 +64,13 @@ class PredictionInput:
     # at the route's own timestamp.  None until the first route arrives, and
     # for scenarios that run without a route.
     route: Any | None  # Route
+    # AlpaBridge additions. Optional with defaults so upstream's own construction
+    # sites need no change: session identity is what the AlpaBridge contract
+    # validator uses to detect session transitions (and therefore to keep its
+    # frozen-camera check from carrying state across a boundary), and what the
+    # audit trail correlates rollout records by.
+    session_uuid: str | None = None
+    debug_scene_id: str | None = None
 
 
 @dataclass
